    "sub_name": "日文(三)",
    "sub_ename": "JAPANESE(3)",
    "describe_ch": "以日文（一）日文（二）的語彙句型為基礎，進一步學習日語的動詞變化形式及其應用句型，達到增加語彙及加長句子的目標，並且能熟習禮貌體句子與普通體句子的轉換。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is based on Japanese I and Japanese II and extended to the types of the verb and their applied sentences. And the target is set to increase the vocabularies and lengthen the sentences. Above of all, it is important to be familiar with transferring the general sentences to polite sentences.",
